The binary equivalent of 30 is 0000000000011110
The binary equivalent of 75 is 0000000001001011
The binary equivalent of 2564 is 0000101000000100
The binary equivalent of 100 is 0000000001100100
The binary equivalent of 255 is 0000000011111111
The binary equivalent of 512 is 0000001000000000
The binary equivalent of 1024 is 0000010000000000
The binary equivalent of 2048 is 0000100000000000
The binary equivalent of 4096 is 0001000000000000
The binary equivalent of 8192 is 0010000000000000
